      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "是的～姐姐们告诉我，\n光凭一己之力是无法荣耀家族的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a82c9ad0acab40fd85a94e9d627b954b6794479bd1f38dcaebece09be3c37658",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
