    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7cea35b5ff41f2f42b3fc4bb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白家一直都在等着你。\n等了好久好久。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2dfd38883cac8bbc2e2912df9eedefdad0106421c22535491e80c56316b288f9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1074/storytimeline_501074109.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        46,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/46/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72d54fb98f9e64dbcbb51801",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白光明的说话声\n听起来就像某种更加巨大的存在的声音。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0d3c3c09768ab1f5e4acd4ce1b9c2ec08994e48a6d2094710d316a84f98a543",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1074/storytimeline_501074109.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        47,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/47/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:190cf5f209762e514d34b269",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "抬头一看，我亲眼看见……\n贯穿时代的河川正流过我们上方的天空。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a0e229ad31ee9a78196cf6d94c78d5fb85ff5a78031272ee3966b307c6cf0f95",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1074/storytimeline_501074109.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        48,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/48/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:86472d6460b1f5b8ce0ce3f1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白光明",
      "source_fingerprint": "0cce4d859896c50ae77983029951d94a41ba9369dc531a5184d37f6b802e9b98",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1074/storytimeline_501074109.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        5,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/5/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:103ec2b45374cb4bc8068b4d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "是的～互相赠送倾注心意的礼物～\n一定会很好玩的～",
      "source_fingerprint": "274c58a8ccd413d83bb98f58383f1be91cb88c5cc4edc67e42719638c44a620f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1074/storytimeline_501074109.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        5,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/5/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:778374cb871727646158828e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "于是她们开始交换礼物。\n第一轮先由无声铃鹿送给待兼福来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "efc5a7a25dab713c9d2f82f83af6677c389f3559ca397187a9d5351f3f890039",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1074/storytimeline_501074109.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        6,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/6/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8529cb8fa7ffc51b8c546549",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "无声铃鹿",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb75d8172527b3c333e07414fc28cbbd82f876b513cb7854a257f05f5e6b2ba3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1074/storytimeline_501074109.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        7,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/7/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f2bc98ac7724bbc1695fe49",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "福来……这个送你。",
      "source_fingerprint": "46b472e1849878e0ca5bd7267358ed94adcaadfbabe9d2dbd8c38db2116e718a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1074/storytimeline_501074109.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        7,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/7/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:30a36f15c8bf4f68caed5eb4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "待兼福来",
      "source_fingerprint": "450312998b7d6fb0a089dc279e6d298f30c5ff5f9aab8f2fff270531c79cc6a6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1074/storytimeline_501074109.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        8,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/8/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:adc2aa25bced33d9e78c133e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "喔喔喔，这是什么呢？\n你还特地放进\n便利商店的塑料袋里啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d933dafde144f9e81afc9a1071a581e7459d92e85e4465d127fa5e18aa197ee6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1074/storytimeline_501074109.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        8,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/8/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5d042928d8993388241e0bc6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "无声铃鹿",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb75d8172527b3c333e07414fc28cbbd82f876b513cb7854a257f05f5e6b2ba3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1074/storytimeline_501074109.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        9,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/9/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e736228ad32a255c499565d9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这是我从便利商店买来的。\n我买了口香糖、充电器……还有胡椒盐。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e59c0b000927a1eb0a518cfd8628265ce88ed55387776b8e55c954f53b66d68",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1074/storytimeline_501074109.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        9,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/9/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc8d50f34b9172b12ef25ff9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "圣诞节",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c2b9803564e34688c4a2ecda1d5008fcc8a7be1bbce708f299726ff438b7ed0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1074/storytimeline_501074109.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:072c5fb39560cdbeebc0a983",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我与目白光明一起度过了\n闪耀系列赛最初的三年。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c7d4f3839bcf217ed1ed02224a1b5515789461eb6aed82f69ec5f0d68d4e2bc2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1074/storytimeline_501074110.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f9bf8c8c165f53d43c53f80f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不过比赛还未就此结束。\n在这段时光中，出线成为\n我们最强劲敌的──",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad9cf7379afb076c74eccf13d22d2c06abd166a7134f528b54e2a38a59457a7c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1074/storytimeline_501074110.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f76800e9ae473d3b5aef9212",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白光明",
      "source_fingerprint": "0cce4d859896c50ae77983029951d94a41ba9369dc531a5184d37f6b802e9b98",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1074/storytimeline_501074110.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        10,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/10/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08f8fdb3fd13db43c26a355e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "咦，特别周大人……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f0467399167167c872057919ac43a40fb8d2a55c7fc47e958d0d6af7dde354de",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1074/storytimeline_501074110.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        10,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/10/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec9fc30da6a30026619741bd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "特别周",
      "source_fingerprint": "d2006eb90c4483cd2444ac5e7378edb673044470d41a5dd967aaabbc498929a3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1074/storytimeline_501074110.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        11,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/11/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b0e69d1c60462a11aa2c73e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "来自目白家的光明选手，\n我非常尊敬你！\n跟你一起比赛时，我觉得你好厉害。",
      "source_fingerprint": "296b3b75b555fb2388c1f6da5de2c657115fac2cd457671524e075733b17f4bd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1074/storytimeline_501074110.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        11,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/11/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bcccd2e07330cf753d959624",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "特别周",
      "source_fingerprint": "d2006eb90c4483cd2444ac5e7378edb673044470d41a5dd967aaabbc498929a3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1074/storytimeline_501074110.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        12,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/12/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:37c14ded816bc0480a134de0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "无论比赛距离有多长，你都一样会在最后的直线\n使出全力。而且又来自全日本最优秀的家族。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb649dbd9c39f3b6970539879312789ee4c6bf07a84bb6d7d52fefe58892cddc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1074/storytimeline_501074110.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        12,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/12/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:78bd56d761962c43de78f41d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "特别周",
      "source_fingerprint": "d2006eb90c4483cd2444ac5e7378edb673044470d41a5dd967aaabbc498929a3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1074/storytimeline_501074110.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        13,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/13/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:11b9b9f3059a0a5b4f995c9c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我不确定自己算不算长途跑者，\n不过……长距离真的很棒呢！",
